From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 4evy <git@evy.pink>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: redate: edit terminal timestamp input with readline

Use readline for terminal timestamp input so cursor movement, insertion,
deletion, and pasted text are handled as editing commands. Preserve
standard prompting for piped input
